      "date": "2026-05-26T11:56:30.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹5.91 (vs ₹4.71 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹5.91 (up from ₹4.71 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹23.6b (up 9.9% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹1.34b (up 26% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 5.7% (up from 5.0% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue is forecast to grow 5.3% p.a. on average during the next 2 years, compared to a 3.8% decline forecast for the Basic Materials industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 2% per year whereas the company’s share price has fallen by 2% per year.",
